  "summary": "Malicious code in @reaxuse/rxjs (npm)",
  "details": "@reaxuse/rxjs is a scoped-name package that mirrors the vueuse/rxjs library name (a React port of the RxJS reactive utilities). This version ships only benign React hook code (toObserver and useWatchExtractedObservable) with no detectable malicious payload, no lifecycle hooks, and no network activity. It is published as part of a broader pattern of scoped-name packages impersonating established reactive-programming libraries.",
